{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>S_list.Semi_concrete</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"soteria","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Soteria","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Data","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"S_list","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Semi_concrete","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Parameters","href":"#parameters","children":[]},{"title":"Signature","href":"#signature","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Operations on <i>semi-concrete</i> lists: lists whose structure (length and order) is concrete, but whose elements are symbolic.</p>","content":"<h2 id=\"parameters\"><a href=\"#parameters\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Parameters</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec parameter anchored\" id=\"argument-1-Symex\"><a href=\"#argument-1-Symex\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> </span><span><a href=\"argument-1-Symex/index.html\">Symex</a></span><span> : <a href=\"../../../Symex/module-type-Base/index.html\">Symex.Base</a></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"signature\"><a href=\"#signature\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Signature</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sort\"><a href=\"#val-sort\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sort : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">leq</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"argument-1-Symex/Value/index.html#type-sbool\">Symex.Value.sbool</a> <a href=\"argument-1-Symex/Value/index.html#type-t\">Symex.Value.t</a></span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> list</span> <a href=\"argument-1-Symex/index.html#type-t\">Symex.t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>sort ~leq l</code> sorts the list <code>l</code> according to the symbolic comparison <code>leq</code>, using an insertion sort; if comparisons are symbolic, this may branch.</p></div></div>"}